{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "main_6_level_main_06-07_end",
  "groupId": "main_6",
  "stageId": "main_06-07",
  "title": "只是从天而降！",
  "storyCode": "6-8",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_06-07_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "82150d24adc6dcc8baffaa8f3bf87147500f0e5ee9ef3552b5b88d26ef0cf08c",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第三关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "哈，哈......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "煌！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "我没事！他们还......真有点本事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "没被冻着吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "让区域内的空气变热阻绝她的寒流，也只有你能做到了。多亏了你，我们没什么损伤。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "小意思。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "用冰的，你怎么不用致死性法术？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "text": "咳，咳......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "原来如此。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "......霜星她那个样子......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "霜星，是吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "text": "咳......帮我......遮一下......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员",
      "text": "大姊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "快走，阿米娅。路上可能还有其他的整合运动。有伤员吗？我可以搭把手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "text": "想这样就撤退？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "我劝你一句。别再战斗了，白毛兔子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "再这么强撑着用法术，你会死得很快。你的力量正在把你的活力榨干。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "或者，你可以来罗德岛。至少我们有办法延续你的生命。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "text": "怎么一副......怜悯他人的样子？谁需要你们的怜悯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "怎么，我看起来像是在可怜你？你挺强的，我是看得起你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "text": "凭什么让你们逃走？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "text": "咳......咳咳......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "Dr.{@nickname}，快走，别看她了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陨星",
      "text": "有整合运动在外围废墟向我们移动！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "text": "别想走。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员",
      "text": "大姊，你现在站的那个位置！别用那个！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "text": "不可以放他们走！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "text": "罗德岛会对龙门的同胞做什么，谁也不知道！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "text": "温差升高，结构，脆化！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "text": "咳，咳......冻结！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "text": "......♪......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "text": "咳......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员",
      "text": "起作用了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员",
      "text": "我们埋设的源石改变了下层结构，地块已经开始倾斜了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员",
      "text": "大姊，你那个位置太危险了，快抱住我！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员",
      "text": "大姊？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陨星",
      "text": "......煌，听见没？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陨星",
      "text": "这是建筑物的碎裂声？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "埋设源石，吸热，温差......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "断裂的建筑墙体，难道......霜星的法术，也可以这样发挥作用吗......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "不好！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "这块地块在变形！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陨星",
      "text": "整合运动还能做到这种事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "说不清，但......整片区域在下沉！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "快走！去稳固的区域呆着，这里的地块要沉陷了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰西卡",
      "text": "......博士？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰西卡",
      "text": "博士，你脚下......开裂了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "完蛋。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "Dr.{@nickname}！跳过来！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "跳什么......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "博士！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "阿米娅，别去！Dr.{@nickname}，先抓住那根电线杆！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "先救博士！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "地面撕裂倾斜的速度太快了，我够不到！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "那我去！！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "不行！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "你说什么——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......没事的。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "博士！！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "陨星",
          "text": "周围的建筑物承受不了自重，正在坠落！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "陨星，接好！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "陨星",
          "text": "好，我带阿米娅走！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "放手！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "阿米娅，你走，我来帮博士！相信我作为罗德岛干员的实力！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "嘁，看来还是要流点血。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "博士，我会用气流和真空压减缓你的坠落速度，撑开你身边的建筑，放心，它们压不到你！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "不要怕！千万不要怕！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "......一会儿见！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "一会儿见。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "怎么？霜星呢？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "......你们的指挥官也掉下去了？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员",
          "text": "......是啊。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员",
          "text": "要么我们别打了吧？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员",
          "text": "罗德岛的兔子，我们暂时休战怎么样？其实我们一开始也不太想和你们打。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "可是各位......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员",
          "text": "梅菲斯特告知大姊，说你杀了亚历克斯，所以大姊非常担忧你们接下来的行动。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "......亚历克斯是？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员",
          "text": "碎骨。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "很抱歉。碎骨确实是被我杀害的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员",
          "text": "......哎。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "感染者本来不该相互为敌的。很抱歉。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员",
          "text": "有什么好道歉的？你们当时在交战吧？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "是。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员",
          "text": "那我们停火吧。大熊，你怎么说？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员",
          "text": "啊？*乌萨斯粗口*！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员",
          "text": "大熊说他也没问题。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜叶",
          "text": "我觉得他不是这么说的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员",
          "text": "只要不在交战状态，就没理由再让谁去杀谁了吧？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "为什么你......会想要停战？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员",
          "text": "你看，我们两边领袖都是兔子。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "......啊？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜叶",
          "text": "我脑海里似乎有什么东西崩溃了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "杰西卡",
          "text": "啊？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜叶",
          "text": "冻原的雪怪居然是这样的人。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "杰西卡",
          "text": "什，什么？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜叶",
          "text": "他们不应该冷血无情，冰块一样吗。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜叶",
          "text": "我不能接受。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员",
          "text": "......那是偏见。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员",
          "text": "小兔子，听我说。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员",
          "text": "战斗的胜负，你们究竟去哪，我们都不关心。我们更在乎大姊的命。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员",
          "text": "你们也在关注队友的安危，不是吗？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "......是的。我们不是为了伤害谁才深入废城的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员",
          "text": "至少，你们不是来搞什么“整合运动感染者大猎杀”的，对不对？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "肯定不。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员",
          "text": "我们倒......不太能否认这个事情。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员",
          "text": "如果不是因为爱国者大爹说整合运动需要团结，我们这就把梅菲斯特和参与他行动的小队全部干掉。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员",
          "text": "那也算整合运动大猎杀了，对吧？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "啊......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
